<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include("./partials/head.ejs") %>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <%- include("./partials/nav.ejs") %>

        <div class="content">
            <!--
            <h3 id="page-title"><b>Track Builder</b></h3>
            -->

            <div>
                <p>
                    Welcome to the <b>Track Builder</b>. You can use this section to build your own tracks.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Tracks are defined as a series of points, starting from Point 1.
                    When more than 3 points are placed, a path if formed between all points.
                    The builder also comes with a grid, showing where race cars can drive to.
                    Race cars can only drive to a point on top of the track path, otherwise they crash!
                </p>
                <p>
                    There are a few track elements to build with:
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>Path:</b> defines the form of the track</li>
                        <li><b>Materials:</b> a track element which affects racer movement</li>
                        <li><b>Obstacle:</b> a track element which causes racers to crash when driven into</li>
                        <li><b>Decoration:</b> a track element which is ornamental and has no effect</li>
                    </ul>
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <hr/>
            
            <div id="build-bar">
                <div id="build-options">
                    <div>
                        <b>Options</b>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <button id="options-details" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Details
                        </button>
                        
                        <button id="options-save" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Save
                        </button>
                        
                        <button id="options-save-as" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Save As
                        </button>

                        <button id="options-undo" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Undo
                        </button>

                        <button id="options-redo" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Redo
                        </button>

                        <button id="options-test" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Test
                        </button>

                        <button id="options-import" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Import
                        </button>

                        <button id="options-export" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Export
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="build-tools" class="mt-3">
                    <div>
                        <b>Tools</b>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <button id="tools-path" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Path
                        </button>

                        <button id="tools-material" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Material
                        </button>

                        <button id="tools-obstacle" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Obstacle
                        </button>

                        <button id="tools-decoration" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                            <br/>Decoration
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="build-container">
                <h5><b>Builder</b></h5>
                <canvas id="build-canvas" width="750" height="750" style="border:1px solid #000000;"></canvas>

                <!-- secondary canvas for grid? -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <%- include("./partials/footer.ejs") %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>